{"unit_id":"studyzy__dsh-suggest-prompt#card-zh","repo":"studyzy/dsh-suggest-prompt","commit":"9a3827b65854109c8e28a64b89fdba1f9893edeb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@studyzy/dsh-suggest-prompt（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在每轮对话完成后生成一条可继续推进工作的建议提示词。宿主读取最近已完成的用户输入和助手回答，调用配置的 LLM 路由生成有长度与时限限制的建议，并保存在插件自己的存储中；Web 输入框以幽灵文字显示，用户可用快捷键或按钮将其填入草稿，也能手动请求生成。插件还在 Plugins 页面提供 provider、model 和快捷键设置。适合希望更快接续 DSH 对话、减少重复输入的 Web 用户。需要可用的 DSH LLM 服务及 Web profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:456-510","src/generate.ts:336-421","src/browser/GhostSuggestion.tsx:134-184","src/browser/SuggestionActions.tsx:36-134"]}
{"unit_id":"studyzy__dsh-suggest-prompt#card-en","repo":"studyzy/dsh-suggest-prompt","commit":"9a3827b65854109c8e28a64b89fdba1f9893edeb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@studyzy/dsh-suggest-prompt generates follow-up prompts for DSH Web. It sends a bounded transcript to the configured LLM, stores the suggestion, and shows it as composer ghost text. Users can accept it into the draft or request one manually. A Plugins page card configures the model and shortcut.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:456-510","src/generate.ts:336-421","src/browser/GhostSuggestion.tsx:134-184","src/browser/SuggestionActions.tsx:36-134"]}
